# Only game/ is the site. This matters when Vercel's Root Directory is left as the
# repo root; with Root Directory set to `game` (see docs/DEPLOY.md) game/.vercelignore
# is the file that applies instead.
#
# Source art is no longer listed here per-glob: it all lives in art-source/, which is
# excluded wholesale below. game/ now contains only what the game loads.
art-source
drafts
node_modules
tests
tools
test-results
playwright-report
qa-report
